# Installer scripts are run by bash on the Mac and their SHA-256 is pinned: LF on every checkout.
*.sh text eol=lf
# Mac sources, plists and entitlements are built and signed on macOS: a CRLF checkout breaks codesign.
macos/** text eol=lf
# Windows sources keep their bytes as committed (the build hashes them indirectly through the exe and install.ps1).
windows/** -text
*.zip binary
*.png binary
*.icns binary
